    <title>vol.45【置顶微醺局-那些花束般的恋爱～】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ecd52a5efbdc148aeab8a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62ecd52a5efbdc148aeab8a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Aug 2022 07:55:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>亲爱的各位听众朋友们大家好！</span></p><p><span>这一期是置顶来电的新系列～【置顶深夜微醺局】</span></p><p><span>主播虎牙（@咦—小虎牙）会每期邀请自己的好朋友在最放松的状态说些大实话～～</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>garlic@修飞机的四井 &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>舒克@贝塔er晴</span></p><br><p><span>本期时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a>&nbsp;你谈过办公室恋情吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a>&nbsp;撩完就跑？我进你退？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>&nbsp;超级用心的生日礼物！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>&nbsp;那些令你死心的时刻！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>&nbsp;有钱人谈恋爱都是直接送车的吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a>&nbsp;姐妹们，没确定关系前别太认真！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>&nbsp;我的初恋是学校门口的奶茶店老板</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>&nbsp;你永远不知道一个女生为了接近你做过多少事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>&nbsp;喜欢就是小心翼翼地试探</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a>&nbsp;如果你喜欢的人不是你命中注定的真命天子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>&nbsp;我的初恋希望我嫁给他，可是我还没到法定年龄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>&nbsp;同桌的你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>&nbsp;因为你，我成为了更好的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a>&nbsp;明知不可能，你还会表白吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a>&nbsp;因为喜欢，所以不勇敢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>&nbsp;那个为了某一个人而找了全班写的同学录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">54:40</a>&nbsp;如果时光倒流，你还会做当初的那个决定吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a>&nbsp;给未来的Ta</span></p><br><p><span>温馨提示：【置顶来电】现有带现场观众的live版及不带观众的纯享版，如果想要来到现场和主播们一起侃大山，请关注公众号：置顶喜剧脱口秀，即可获得购票方式哦。</span></p><br><p><span>另外，置顶来电有听众群啦！</span></p><p><span>添加VX:ZDXJXZL001</span></p><p><span>进群和你们喜欢的主播们一起聊天吧！</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
